Makrura Meat Drop
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Owner of (Killing unit)) Not equal to Neutral Hostile
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Prawn
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Pooldweller
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Tidecaller
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Deepseer
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Snapper
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Makrura Tidal Lord
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Random integer number between 1 and 10) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DyingUnitPos = (Position of (Dying unit))
                Item - Create Raw Makrura Meat at DyingUnitPos
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DyingUnitPos)
            Else - Actions
